          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n- The applicant must be a farmer.\n- The applicant must belong to the Gujarat state.\n- The applicant must purchase a medium-sized goods vehicle (600kg to 1500kg capacity) from an [authorized dealer](https://ikhedut.gujarat.gov.in/Public/frm_Public_DealerDetails.aspx).\n"
        },
